Yes, you could use try().  Roughly:

boot.nLS <- bootstrap(DATA,  {
  result <- try(coef(eval(nLS.Object$call)))
  if(it was an error)
    rep(NA, the right length for a coef vector)
  else
    result
  })

Tim Hesterberg

