Hi,

If mydf is your dataframe, this should do the trick: mydf <-
mydf[,which(apply(mydf,2, function(x) is.element(NA,x))==F)]

Be aware though that this will transform your data frame into a vector
if only one column has no NA values.

Hope it helps

